  "description": "The Adobe PDF Library WebToPDF plug-in converts HTML and web content to PDF using a bundled Chromium runtime driven by the Adobe PDF Library.\n\nReference this package alongside the Adobe PDF Library package (Adobe.PDF.Library.LM.NET). Everything the plug-in needs is copied to your build output automatically; when publishing for a different platform, pass the target runtime (for example dotnet publish -r linux-x64).\n\nSupported platforms: win-x64, win-arm64, linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64.",
